      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it's more than just \"thinking\" about it. it feels heavy, u know? like, if there's no grand design or any actual reason for us to be here, then all the struggle—the working, the hurting, the trying to find happiness—it's all just noise. it feels like we're just fighting a losing battle against entropy for no reason at all. it's just... exhausting to keep pretending there's a point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
